OL,5,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FDr Taylor begins her day with
OL,7,     FRebecca who has been in A&E
OL,8,     Fovernight with a kidney infection.
OL,9,     FDr Savage meets Charlotte who has
OL,10,     Fa painful and swollen arm.
OL,11,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,12,     FAs a heatwave hits Barnsley,
OL,13,     Fpressure increases for sister Jane
OL,14,     Fin casualty. Among those seeking
OL,15,     Femergency treatment are
OL,16,     F65-year-old Theresa, with a
OL,17,     Fpossible stroke.
