OL,12,G0000 Surgeons: A Matter of Life or
OL,13,G     Death
OL,14,     FAn ENT surgeon must operate on
OL,15,     FSarah, whose bone tumour is
OL,16,     Fpushing into her skull. Mike, who
OL,17,     Fhas pancreatic cancer, has a
OL,18,     Fhigh-risk but potentially
OL,19,     Flife-saving operation.
